  "job_B1.3.10_20251001_193156": {
    "text": "DE SANCTA LUCIA UIRGO.\n\u00d0A ASPRANG AGATHEN HLISA OFER LAND AND S\u00c6, SWA \u00fe\u00e6t fram Siracusa sohte mycel\n\u00dea com sum wydewe, seo w\u00e6s geciged Euthicia, betwux o\u00f0rum mannum to \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6ran byrigene, and\nSeo wydewe w\u00e6s unhal, swa \u00fe\u00e6t hire arn blod geond feower geare f\u00e6c, and f\u00e6la l\u00e6ca cunnode, ac hi\nHit gelamp \u00f0a \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6ssan, \u00fe\u00e6t man r\u00e6dde \u00fe\u00e6t godspell, hu \u00fe\u00e6t wif wear\u00f0 geh\u00e6led, \u00fee w\u00e6s on\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Lucia mid geleafan to hire meder, Gif \u00feu gelyfst, modor, \u00feysum m\u00e6ran godspelle, gelyf \u00fe\u00e6t\nGehrepa hire byrigene, and \u00feu bist sona hal.\n\u00dea \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6ssan seo modor and seo dohtor astrehton hi on gebedum \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re byrgene.\nMid \u00feam \u00fee hi lagon and gelencgdon \u00f0a gebedu, \u00fea wear\u00f0 Lucia on sl\u00e6pe, and geseah Agathen betwux\n\u00deinre meder geheolp \u00fein halga geleafa, and efne heo is geh\u00e6led halwendlice \u00f0urh Crist.\nAnd swa swa \u00feeos burh is gem\u00e6rsod \u00feurh me fram Criste, swa bi\u00f0 Siracusa burh \u00feurh \u00fee gewlitegod,\nAnd \u00f0a awoc Lucia.\nHeo aras \u00f0a bifigende for \u00f0\u00e6re beorhtan gesih\u00f0e, and s\u00e6de to hire meder, \u00feu eart mihtiglice geh\u00e6led.\nNu bidde ic \u00fee, \u00feurh \u00fea ylcan \u00fee \u00fee mid gebedum geh\u00e6lde, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu nanne brydguman n\u00e6fre me ne\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 seo modor, mine \u00feincg \u00feu wast, and ic heold nu nigon gear wi\u00f0 ealle hyn\u00f0a \u00feines f\u00e6der\nBeluc \u00e6rest mine eagan, and \u00fea \u00e6hta ateoh loca hu \u00fee licige, min leofa dohtor.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Lucia, hlyst mines r\u00e6des; ne miht \u00f0u naht l\u00e6dan of \u00feysum life mid \u00fee, and \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu on dea\u00f0e\nAc syle nu on gesundfulnysse \u00feam so\u00f0an H\u00e6lende swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00feu gemyntest on for\u00f0si\u00fee to donne.\n\u00deus tihte Lucia gelome \u00fea modor, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heo beceapode \u00fea scinendan gymmas, and eac hire landare\n\u00deis com \u00fea to earan \u00feam \u00e6\u00f0elborenan cnihte \u00fee awogode Lucian, se w\u00e6s geciged Pascasius, arleas\nAc \u00fe\u00e6t drihtnes m\u00e6den cw\u00e6\u00f0, Hluttor offrung \u00fe\u00e6t is, and licwur\u00f0e Gode, \u00fe\u00e6t mann wydewan\nNe dreah ic nu \u00ferym gearum nane o\u00fere d\u00e6da, butan \u00feam lyfigendan drihtne \u00feas lac geoffrode.\nNu ic wylle me sylfe him so\u00f0lice geoffrian, for\u00f0an ic leng n\u00e6bbe hw\u00e6t ic on his lacum aspende.\n\u00dea yrsode Pascasius, and hi spr\u00e6con fela, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he hire swingele behet gif heo suwian nolde.\nLucia him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, \u00fe\u00e6s lifigendan Godes word ne magon geswican, ne forsuwode beon.\nHe axode \u00f0a mid olle, Eart \u00feu la God?\nLucia him andwyrde, Ic eom \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6lmihtigan \u00feinen; for\u00fei ic cw\u00e6\u00f0 Godes word, for\u00fean \u00fee he on his\nEft \u00fea Pascasius orgellice befran, Wuna\u00f0 se halga gast on \u00fee eornostlice?\nLucia andwyrde \u00feam arleasan and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Se apostol behet \u00feam \u00f0e healda\u00f0 cl\u00e6nnysse, \u00fe\u00e6t hi synd\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se arleasa, Ic hate \u00fee ardlice l\u00e6dan to \u00fe\u00e6ra myltestrena huse, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u \u00feinne m\u00e6g\u00f0had forleose,\nLucia andwyrde \u00feus, ne bi\u00f0 \u00e6nig gewemmed lichama to plihte gif hit ne lica\u00f0 \u00feam mode.\n\u00deeah \u00feu mine hand ahebbe to \u00f0inum h\u00e6\u00feengilde, and swa \u00feurh me geoffrige mines unwilles, ic beo\nGif \u00feu me unwilles gewemman nu dest, me bi\u00f0 twifeald cl\u00e6nnysse geteald to wuldre.\nNe miht \u00feu gebigan minne willan to \u00fee, swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00feu minum lichaman dest, ne m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t belimpan\n\u00dea wolde se w\u00e6lhreowa his word gefyllan, \u00fe\u00e6t heo wurde gel\u00e6d to \u00fe\u00e6re la\u00f0an fulnysse, and begunnon\n\u00dea cnitton hi rapas mid re\u00f0um anginne hire to handum and fotum, and fela samod tugon, ac heo n\u00e6s\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 geancsumod se arleasa Pascasius, and het him gelangian \u00fea leasan drymen to, \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00fe\u00e6t\nAc \u00f0a\u00fea him naht ne speow, \u00fea het he spannan oxan to, ac hi ne mihton awecgan \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den \u00feagit\nSe cwellere \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam cl\u00e6nan m\u00e6dene, hw\u00e6t is se intinga \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00feusend manna \u00fee ne magon\nLucia him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, \u00feeah \u00feu clypige tyn \u00feusend manna, hi sceolan ealle gehyran \u00feone halgan gast \u00feus\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 se arleasa geancsumod eft swi\u00f0or on mode, and het mycel ad ontendan on ymbhwyrfte \u00fe\u00e6s\nHeo stod \u00fea unforht on \u00feam fyre and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic ab\u00e6d \u00e6t Criste \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0is cwealmb\u00e6ra fyr me ne\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 se w\u00e6lhreowa wodlice geancsumod, \u00fe\u00e6t his magas ne mihton his modleaste acuman; Ac\nHeo wear\u00f0 \u00fea gewundod, \u00fe\u00e6t hire wand se inno\u00f0 ut, ac heo ne gewat swa \u00feeah, ac \u00feurhwunode on\nSwa swa seo Catanenscisce burh binnan hire weallum h\u00e6f\u00f0 minre swyster Agathen miccle\nMid \u00feam \u00fee heo \u00feis spr\u00e6c, wear\u00fe se manfulla Pascasius mid racenteagum gebunden, and beforan \u00f0am\nHe w\u00e6s \u00e6r gewreged for his w\u00e6lhreowum d\u00e6dum, to Romaniscre leode, \u00fee \u00f0a ealle land geweolden.\nHe wear\u00f0 \u00fea gebroht on bendum to Rome, and \u00fea witan heton hine beheafdian, \u00fea\u00fea he ne mihte his\nSeo eadiga Lucia on \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan stowe wunode \u00fee heo ofslagen w\u00e6s, o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t sacerdas coman and hi\nAnd heo gewat to Criste mid \u00feam \u00fee hi cw\u00e6don amen.\n\u00dea ar\u00e6rde \u00fea leoda \u00fe\u00e6r heo l\u00e6g cyrcan, and on hire naman gehalgodon, \u00feam h\u00e6lende to wur\u00f0mynte",
